  "details": "In the Avatar Dynamics update on stable, a useful feature was removed: Limit Dynamic Bone Usage has no equivalent on PhysBones. \nThe Medium limits are these: \nPhysBones Affected Transforms: 128\nPhysBones Collision Check Count: 256\nAlso, by the way, I think that stats like polygon count and materials should be factored into brand new “macro” stats like “GPU Usage”, “VRAM Usage”, and “CPU Usage” to account for certain avatar rigs that say, have too many components relative to their PhysBone transforms count to fit [insert name] rank.",
